        "valueString": "Lump has not really changed since review about 3 weeks ago; patient notices it more when typing. Intermittent mild ache rated 2–3/10 after prolonged keyboard or mouse use and yoga/planks. No pain at rest and no night waking."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
