          "text": "Right dorsal wrist examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Smooth, round, cystic swelling over the scapholunate area; skin normal, no redness or warmth. Mild tenderness only on deep palpation; mobile and tethered deep; transilluminates. Full range of motion with mild tightness at end extension only. Power 5/5 and neurovascularly intact."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
